Centro de Ocio y Asesoramiento Juvenil - 2 planta.",
		"relation": "http://www.madrid.es/sites/v/index.jsp?vgnextchannel=bfa48ab43d6bb410VgnVCM100000171f5a0aRCRD&vgnextoid=9721133100fbf810VgnVCM1000001d4a900aRCRD",		
		"address": {
			"district": {
